      "difficulty_level": "H3",
      "difficulty_reason": "The author constructs compatible cellular higher operations by reducing decorated trees to local tree operads, filling inner and external dendroidal horns in the Boardman-Vogt cylinder, and pasting relative cellular approximations without changing prescribed objects. Two-sided monadic bar realization and a further horn filling produce strict CW rectification. Ordinary objectwise cellular approximation alone does not supply these coherent higher operations. The approximation and its rectification are bundled as one principal object.",
